---
description: Use Mark when the user wants to plan, draft, review or approve social posts, check search or AI-assistant visibility, or research keywords in their Mark workspace.
alwaysApply: false
---

For these jobs, use the `mark` MCP tools and the Mark skills. Don't write the
content or the report from scratch.

If the `mark` tools are missing, ask the user to connect Mark first: Settings,
MCP, then Connect next to mark. They sign in and pick the workspace.

Call `get_workspace` to confirm the workspace before you change anything.

Approving a post with `approve_posts` publishes it at its scheduled time. Show
the user what you will approve and get their explicit OK first.
